#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodaudioeffectfilter.rst:16 5aa534bb3ceb472488216043e4a9ecb8
msgid "A multi-mode filter effect supporting lowpass, highpass, and bandpass filter types."
msgstr "滤波器效果，用于按截止频率、斜率、增益和共振塑造频率响应。"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodaudioeffectfilter.rst:21 f7a20ed623924cf19bd0f1098f5a307b
msgid "Description"
msgstr "描述"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodaudioeffectfilter.rst:23 00c72ca068ec45a59bb6457e646004b6
msgid ""
"FmodAudioEffectFilter is a versatile filter that can operate in multiple modes (lowpass, "
"highpass, bandpass) to shape the frequency content of an audio signal. It provides control over "
"cutoff frequency, rolloff steepness, gain, and resonance."
msgstr ""
"**FmodAudioEffectFilter**    提供基础滤波控制，可通过    ``cutoff_hz``    设置截止频率，通过    ``db``    选择截止曲线斜率，并用"
"    ``gain``    与    ``resonance``    调整滤波后的信号强度和共振感。它适合制作低通、高通、遮挡、远近感或菜单过渡等效果。"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodaudioeffectfilter.rst:25 7dc1b393239446ef8edbfb82eccfb537
msgid ""
"This effect is useful for removing unwanted frequencies, creating muffled or telephone-like "
"sounds, isolating frequency bands, or adding character to audio through resonance."
msgstr "用于去除不需要的频率、制作闷声或电话音效、隔离频段，也可通过谐振改变音色。"

